MuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"pllvqx8yMnLnQVFjj3oYGg","review_id":"P6fHsLm7FsdagqlzakTb_Q","date":"2014-01-09T19:45:51","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9428256154060364,"text_excerpt":"One of my new favorite restaurants! We recently moved to Mid-City and are in the process of trying out new places. Venezia was one of the last ones we made it to and for that I'm ashamed. The food was AMAZING! We got a type of veal parmesean in a sauce (I can't remember what it was called, sorry) and it was literally one of those things you take a bite of and go \"Oh my god...that is so good.\" The seafood stuffed mushrooms as an appetizer were also amazing. Not the best I've had, but excellent. The portions were nice and I was able to take leftovers to work the next day. Service was great and the restaurant had a good atmosphere overall. I'll definitely be back here."},{"business_id":"pllvqx8yMnLnQVFjj3oYGg","review_id":"Rkvzc7ocGY077dvXmFGYXw","date":"2018-07-15T14:12:44","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9372183680534363,"text_excerpt":"Went for the classic Pizza and Italian Salad. Always delicious and the staff very attentive. We tried the House Special Pizza It was topped with pepperoni , sausage, mushroom and artichoke hearts, I loved it. If you want good Italian good and not over priced go to Venezia's"},{"business_id":"pllvqx8yMnLnQVFjj3oYGg","review_id":"XnIEnerMsqF0on3yjQX40w","date":"2015-01-03T16:44:41","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9369374513626099,"text_excerpt":"Friendly family friendly Italian restaurant. This place smells amazing upon walking in. Roasted garlic and cheese. We came to spend a gift card and so we ordered enough to feed an army and was happy. we ordered the veal cannelloni. The dish was hot, portion size was large, and they had plenty of flavor. we also ordered the chicken parmesan. Same with the cannelloni, large portion etc. We got the side of garlic cheese bread which was really good. And we got a large pizza to go. The pizza was great and re heats well. Try this place out for a local Italian eatery."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"pllvqx8yMnLnQVFjj3oYGg","photo_id":"4u-oeb267PG02D1yXtXBJw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/4u-oeb267PG02D1yXtXBJw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8803644180297852},{"business_id":"pllvqx8yMnLnQVFjj3oYGg","photo_id":"NQKkRM8E3uqkJoGwAAAL0Q","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/NQKkRM8E3uqkJoGwAAAL0Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.849867582321167},{"business_id":"pllvqx8yMnLnQVFjj3oYGg","photo_id":"nmP6kaI7qsC6lfFEANj42A","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/nmP6kaI7qsC6lfFEANj42A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8418288826942444},{"business_id":"pllvqx8yMnLnQVFjj3oYGg","photo_id":"XU-xwd7fX4B9CFiWgyNVpg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/XU-xwd7fX4B9CFiWgyNVpg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8378949761390686},{"business_id":"pllvqx8yMnLnQVFjj3oYGg","photo_id":"6rHamJQxGsBNB4F4uDkV1g","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/6rHamJQxGsBNB4F4uDkV1g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8267056345939636}]},"notebook_case":null}
